      "text": "Standard SAE analysis applied to hadapted conflates base model representations with adapter\ncontributions. To isolate what the adapter adds, we work directly with the activation delta.\nFrom Equation 2, h\u2206= hadapted \u2212hbase is the exact adapter contribution \u2014 mechanistically\nclean and free of base model signal.\n",
